---
import Container from '@/core/components/Container.astro'
---

<section class='border-b border-rule bg-paper-elevated py-14 sm:py-20'>
	<Container>
		<div class='max-w-4xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12'>
			<div class='lg:col-span-4'>
				<span class='font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-clay'>01 / WHY SUPPORT</span>
				<h2 class='mt-2 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-ink'>Built in the open, sustained by builders.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class='lg:col-span-8 space-y-4 font-accent text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary'>
				<p>
					DuneUI was created to raise the baseline of open-source Tailwind CSS interfaces—offering architectural restraint, crisp typography, and zero-bloat markup to everyone.
				</p>
				<p>
					Contributions directly support engineering hours, accessibility testing across screen readers and viewports, and new pure CSS &amp; Tailwind v4 component families.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Container>
</section>
